Package: xcas
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Graphical interface for the Giac computer algebra system
 Xcas is a graphical frontend for the Giac library, built with FLTK.
 It provides an interactive environment for symbolic and numeric
 computation, including:
    - Expression expansion and factorization
    - Equation and system solving
    - Calculus (integration, differentiation)
    - 2D and 3D curve plotting
    - Spreadsheet with CAS formulas
 .
 The Giac library (libgiac) is available as a separate package.
